                <head>210. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>The UN General Assembly approved Resolution 2961B (XXVII) lowering the maximum
                    contribution of any member state to ordinary UN expenses to 25 percent on
                    December 13, 1972, by a vote of 81 in favor, 27 against, with 22 abstaining and
                    2 absent. (Yearbook of the United Nations, 1972 (New York, 1975), pages 712 and
                    717)</p>
            </div>
